      "position": 0,
      "content": "SPANISH, B.A.",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2e6f6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 1,
      "content": "1. Access the University Catalog for Programs and Degrees, General Education Requirements, and Graduation Requirements at CSUCI. 2. Access the Program Website and Program Information in the University Catalog. 3. Access Transfer 2-year or Freshman 4-year Academic Roadmaps. 4. Access the Admissions website for CSUCI admission requirements. 5. Access the Transfer Credit website for information about Associate Degrees for Transfer, and transfer credit resources for external exams and U.S. Military service. 6. Learn more About CSUCI . Articulation agreements are subject to change from one academic year to the next. It is recommended to review the applicable department agreement(s) in addition to the major agreement and that students meet with a counselor/academic advisor early and often during their academic career.",
      "contentHtml": "<p>1.&nbsp;Access&nbsp;the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://catalog.csuci.edu/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">University&nbsp;Catalog</a>&nbsp;for&nbsp;Programs&nbsp;and&nbsp;Degrees,&nbsp;General&nbsp;Education&nbsp;Requirements,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Graduation&nbsp;Requirements&nbsp;at&nbsp;CSUCI.</p><p>2.&nbsp;Access&nbsp;the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://spanish.csuci.edu/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Program&nbsp;Website</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://catalog.csuci.edu/preview_entity.php?catoid=64&amp;ent_oid=3932&amp;returnto=8136\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Program&nbsp;Information</a>&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;University&nbsp;Catalog.</p><p>3.&nbsp;Access&nbsp;<a href=\"https://catalog.csuci.edu/preview_program.php?catoid=64&amp;poid=16991&amp;returnto=8136\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Transfer&nbsp;2-year</a>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<a href=\"https://catalog.csuci.edu/preview_program.php?catoid=64&amp;poid=17003&amp;returnto=8136\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Freshman&nbsp;4-year</a>&nbsp;Academic&nbsp;Roadmaps.</p><p>4.&nbsp;Access&nbsp;the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.csuci.edu/admissions/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Admissions</a>&nbsp;website&nbsp;for&nbsp;CSUCI&nbsp;admission&nbsp;requirements.</p><p>5.&nbsp;Access&nbsp;the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.csuci.edu/registrar/transfer-credit.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Transfer&nbsp;Credit</a>&nbsp;website&nbsp;for&nbsp;information&nbsp;about&nbsp;Associate&nbsp;Degrees&nbsp;for&nbsp;Transfer,&nbsp;and&nbsp;transfer&nbsp;credit&nbsp;resources&nbsp;for&nbsp;external&nbsp;exams&nbsp;and&nbsp;U.S.&nbsp;Military&nbsp;service.</p><p>6.&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;more&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.csuci.edu/about/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">About&nbsp;CSUCI</a>.</p><p></p><p>Articulation&nbsp;agreements&nbsp;are&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;change&nbsp;from&nbsp;one&nbsp;academic&nbsp;year&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;next.&nbsp;It&nbsp;is&nbsp;recommended&nbsp;to&nbsp;review&nbsp;the&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;department&nbsp;agreement(s)&nbsp;in&nbsp;addition&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;major&nbsp;agreement&nbsp;and&nbsp;that&nbsp;students&nbsp;meet&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;counselor/academic&nbsp;advisor&nbsp;early&nbsp;and&nbsp;often&nbsp;during&nbsp;their&nbsp;academic&nbsp;career.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "4d6f6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralTitle",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 2,
      "content": "GENERAL INFORMATION",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "536f6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 3,
      "content": "1. The following apply to the Lower Division Requirements section below: 1. Students who enter the Spanish program with the equivalent of the first-year of college-level Spanish completed at a high school or community college may have satisfied the SPAN 101 and 102 requirement. For more information, review the following webpages and contact the Spanish Program Faculty Advisor with any questions: 1. AP, CLEP, IB, and Military Credit: https://www.csuci.edu/registrar/transfer-credit-resources/external-exams.htm 2. Placement Guidelines: http://spanish.csuci.edu/plcguidcorsdesc.htm 2. Heritage speakers are encouraged to enroll in SPAN 211 and 212. Higher-level speakers may begin at SPAN 301 or 302 with Spanish Program Faculty Advisor approval.",
      "contentHtml": "<p>1.&nbsp;The&nbsp;following&nbsp;apply&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;Lower&nbsp;Division&nbsp;Requirements&nbsp;section&nbsp;below:</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">1.&nbsp;Students&nbsp;who&nbsp;enter&nbsp;the&nbsp;Spanish&nbsp;program&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;equivalent&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;first-year&nbsp;of&nbsp;college-level&nbsp;Spanish&nbsp;completed&nbsp;at&nbsp;a&nbsp;high&nbsp;school&nbsp;or&nbsp;community&nbsp;college&nbsp;may&nbsp;have&nbsp;satisfied&nbsp;the&nbsp;SPAN&nbsp;101&nbsp;and&nbsp;102&nbsp;requirement.&nbsp;For&nbsp;more&nbsp;information,&nbsp;review&nbsp;the&nbsp;following&nbsp;webpages&nbsp;and&nbsp;contact&nbsp;the&nbsp;Spanish&nbsp;Program&nbsp;Faculty&nbsp;Advisor&nbsp;with&nbsp;any&nbsp;questions:</p><p class=\"ql-indent-2\">1.&nbsp;AP,&nbsp;CLEP,&nbsp;IB,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Military&nbsp;Credit:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.csuci.edu/registrar/transfer-credit-resources/external-exams.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.csuci.edu/registrar/transfer-credit-resources/external-exams.htm</a></p><p class=\"ql-indent-2\">2.&nbsp;Placement&nbsp;Guidelines:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://spanish.csuci.edu/plcguidcorsdesc.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://spanish.csuci.edu/plcguidcorsdesc.htm</a></p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">2.&nbsp;Heritage&nbsp;speakers&nbsp;are&nbsp;encouraged&nbsp;to&nbsp;enroll&nbsp;in&nbsp;SPAN&nbsp;211&nbsp;and&nbsp;212.&nbsp;Higher-level&nbsp;speakers&nbsp;may&nbsp;begin&nbsp;at&nbsp;SPAN&nbsp;301&nbsp;or&nbsp;302&nbsp;with&nbsp;Spanish&nbsp;Program&nbsp;Faculty&nbsp;Advisor&nbsp;approval.</p>"
    }
  ],
